{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台在早上8時40分發出黃色暴雨警告信號。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在灣仔，不少市民都撐著傘。天文台指，香港廣泛地區已錄得或預料會有每小時雨量超過30毫米的大雨，雨勢可能持續。一些低窪地帶及排水欠佳地區會出現水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0930.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZuTl9MnNb31786672091.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0930.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">預測今日大致多雲，間中有驟雨及狂風雷暴，初時雨勢有時頗大。明日初時部分地區驟雨仍然較多及有雷暴，日間短暫時間有陽光。隨後一兩日日間酷熱，但有幾陣驟雨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0900.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026LxGGD3C5Bu1786669518.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0900.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T02:59:56.381153+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}